1174
00:58:53,260 --> 00:58:55,540
length is working really well.

1175
00:58:55,540 --> 00:58:59,360
This is basically Agentic
Context Engineering-style paper.

1176
00:58:59,360 --> 00:59:02,260
So it's basically-- there's a
recent paper called "Agentic

1177
00:59:02,260 --> 00:59:03,280
Context Engineering."

1178
00:59:03,280 --> 00:59:05,540
So essentially,
the limitation here

1179
00:59:05,540 --> 00:59:07,980
is coming from what can
