00:59:22,540 --> 00:59:23,980
OK.

1185
00:59:23,980 --> 00:59:25,520
So let's look at the example.

1186
00:59:25,520 --> 00:59:27,965
So we were covering this
example of carbon atom

1187
00:59:27,965 --> 00:59:30,340
count in product 3 based on
a bunch of different chemical

1188
00:59:30,340 --> 00:59:31,500
reactions.

1189
00:59:31,500 --> 00:59:33,100
In vanilla reasoning,
the challenge

